<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/35/eng@/~cl_2__para_d> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for the definition of \"operator\" the following definition: ' \"operator\" means a company or a society which carries on takaful business registered under section 8 and includes an international takaful operator registered under section 40B;'; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/35/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/35/eng@/~cl_2__para_e> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/35/eng@/~cl_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/35/eng@> .
