<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/35/eng@/~cl_8> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 68 the following section: \"Power to issue guidelines, etc. 69. The Director General or the Minister may, from time to time, issue such guidelines, circulars or notes as the Director General or the Minister may deem expedient or necessary for carrying into effect the objects of this Act.\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/35/eng@> .
